{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The chess roguelike. Play game-changing cards, bend the rules, save your Queen, and escape from the dungeon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/escape.png?t=1745412532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat opponents of ever increasing difficulty to escape from the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build</strong> your chess army. Start with just a few figures and recruit more as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect</strong>  cards to turn the tides of the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defeat</strong> each enemy Queen on your way to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/Section_Divider.png?t=1745412532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/bend_the_rules.png?t=1745412532\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play cards to bend the rules of the game in your favour and win against unbeatable opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/card_swipe.gif?t=1745412532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend mana to play cards such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon a <strong>Shape Shifter</strong> that transforms into a random figure each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start a <strong>zombie outbreak</strong> - zombie figures do not care for the colour and attack white or black equally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch an <strong>ICBM nuke</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build <strong>walls</strong> and <strong>traps</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch a <strong>propaganda campaign</strong> to turn enemy figures into your colour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And many others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/Section_Divider.png?t=1745412532\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/power_up.png?t=1745412532\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To win you either need to get smarter or to get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every game you accumulate mana to buy new cards and chess pieces that stay with you in each new run.\u00a0<i>Maybe</i> you would even get a chance at escaping from the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/shop.png?t=1745412532\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most of your upgrades will persist between runs, helping you to get closer and closer to the exit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unbeatable Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is using the state-of-the-art Stockfish chess engine that is impossible to win against for a human... unless you had some cards up your sleeves.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609980?t=1745412532","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/35d339d1ca2e40110f3181762526554e31a8e9e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745412532","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/650fc83ae44f8bd5674aa5f22d5ec22ffda9af76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745412532","capsule_ima